//local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-785467","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Udvikling af børnesensitive og eksperimenterende forskningstilgange og metoder i et dynamisk samspil med de børn, hvis viden og perspektiver, vi er interesserede i, er en forudsætning for børnenes oplevelse af deltagelse i et forskningsprojekt. Samtidig er det børnesensitive og eksperimenterende centralt, for at den viden, vi skaber, kan indeholde transformative potentialer, der kan afstedkomme reelle forandringer hos de børn og fagprofessionelle, forskningen handler om. Dette symposium er bygget op omkring en præsentation af og debat mellem tre igangværende forskningsprojekter, som har det til fælles, at de alle er forankret i forskningsmiljøet om Børns Trivsel på VIA University College. Derudover eksperimenterer de alle metodisk med a følge børns optagetheder og med at skabe deltagelsesmuligheder for dem i forskningsprocesser - med det formål at skabe ny viden, der potentielt kan ændre og kvalificere fagprofessionelles dømme- og handlekraft for børn generelt og i forbindelse med udsathed","author_count":8,"contributors":["Koch, Anette Boye","Jørgensen, Hanne Hede","Blomgren, Henriette","Søndberg, Anne","Friis, Dorthe","Brandt, Erika Zimmer","Lund, Ole","Hansen, Niels Nørrind"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-792644"],"event":{"end":"2024-10-25","place":"Børkop","start":"2024-10-24","title":"NUBU Forskningstræf 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Børns deltagelse","Børns perspektiver","Eksperimenter","Kreative aktiviteter","Metode"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"børnesensitive og eksperimenterende forskningsmetoder","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-792644","ids":["via-a5129198-7133-4818-85d9-9e476cca5074"],"keyword":["børns deltagelse","børns perspektiver","eksperimenter","kreative aktiviteter","metode"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B647FFAD619F81426E81785E1CAC0C5E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for pædagogik og dannelse, Program for børns trivsel"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anette Boye","key":"kochpau","last":"Koch","locid":"0b63e40c-351a-443f-a7b1-304478345dd6","name":"Koch, Anette Boye","orcid":"0000-0002-6281-9113","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Hede","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"c61c085b-62bf-43c7-83fb-77dee7f0eb9a","name":"Jørgensen, Hanne Hede","orcid":"0000-0002-4002-8038","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henriette","key":"blomgrenpau","last":"Blomgren","locid":"aefdf5c0-bae2-4058-bd60-d8d3e94f0f3d","name":"Blomgren, Henriette","orcid":"0000-0003-4162-4904","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne","key":"søndbergpau","last":"Søndberg","locid":"d2eee517-329a-4f19-b5a8-985bc7b5ec90","name":"Søndberg, Anne","orcid":"0000-0003-2821-1048","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorthe","key":"friispau","last":"Friis","locid":"cf1649c4-537e-42a4-9d56-bae93a6ce008","name":"Friis, Dorthe","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erika Zimmer","key":"brandtpau","last":"Brandt","locid":"8672ff57-b920-4dc3-9084-c8a60581b54b","name":"Brandt, Erika Zimmer","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"lundpau","last":"Lund","locid":"7a87b13f-669b-4006-8e75-a582e112c518","name":"Lund, Ole","orcid":"0000-0002-1479-5954","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels Nørrind","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"8f70ea83-3193-4b5f-a1c4-bd4db651cd8c","name":"Hansen, Niels Nørrind","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-a5129198-7133-4818-85d9-9e476cca5074"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"Børnesensitive og eksperimenterende forskningsmetoder","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-792644","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Unspecific symptoms of anxiety and distress are frequently encountered in patients in both general practice and acute psychiatric services. Minor tranquillizers may be a treatment option when non-pharmacological interventions are insufficient or unavailable. We conducted a systematic review with network meta-analysis of the evidence for short-term (1–4 weeks) pharmacological treatment of newly onset symptoms of anxiety and distress. We searched the PsycInfo, MEDLINE, EMBASE and Cochrane Library databases and extracted data following a predefined hierarchy of outcomes. We assessed risk of bias using the Cochrane Risk of Bias tool and the certainty of the evidence using the Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development and Evaluation framework (GRADE). We included 34 randomized trials comprising a total of 7044 patients with adjustment disorders or anxiety spectrum disorders. The network meta-analysis showed that regarding the critical outcome symptoms of anxiety within 1–4 weeks benzodiazepines (SMD − 0.58, 95% CI − 0.77 to − 0.40), quetiapine (SMD − 0.51, 95% CI − 0.90 to − 0.13) and pregabalin (SMD − 0.58, 95% CI − 0.87 to − 0.28) all performed better than placebo with no statistically significant difference between the drugs. Data on other important outcomes were inconsistently reported. Adverse effects varied, but overall, it was uncertain whether adverse effects differed between interventions. The evidence regarding the risk of dependence was uncertain, but dependence may be a concern in susceptible individuals even with short-term treatment. Overall, the certainty of the evidence according to GRADE was rated as low to very low across outcomes. Despite the limitations in the evidence, the results of this review can inform treatment guidelines, supporting clinicians in the choice of minor tranquillizer in this prevalent and help-seeking, clinically heterogeneous population.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Munkholm, Klaus","Ussing, Anja","Brink, Maria","Edemann-Callesen, Henriette","Canbolat, Sengül Sari","Christensen, Robin","Dahl, Kristine Søgaard","Ebdrup, Bjørn H.","Jensen, Mikkel Erik Juul","Lassen, Casper Kierulf","Madsen, Gitte Krogh","Nielsen, Sabrina Mai","Paulsen, Camilla Paludan","Rohde, Jeanett Friis","Tarp, Simon","Baandrup, Lone"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-767433"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Munkholm, Klaus"],"keyword":["Anti Anxiety Agents adverse effects","Anxiety","Anxiety Disorders drug therapy","Anxiety therapy","Distress","Humans","Minor tranquilizers","Network Meta Analysis","Randomized Controlled Trials as Topic","Systematic review"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR"],"OT":["Danish Health Authority"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"minor tranquillizers for short term treatment of newly onset symptoms of anxiety and distress a systematic review with network meta analysis of randomized trials","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00406-023-01680-0","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The Parker Institute, Bispebjerg and Frederiksberg Hospital is supported by a core grant from the Oak Foundation (OCAY-18-774-OFIL)."],"id":"S03-100.00-767433","identifier":[{"id":"37624378","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85168957352","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10995039","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-4b4672e1-90fb-4618-8c1f-23037f44d632","ku-0adca1fc-4e1d-4e4f-a6dd-d4eae9163076","sdu-ad2748a8-6cb7-47d8-a208-2d9334199996"],"keyword":["Anti-Anxiety Agents/adverse effects","Anxiety","Anxiety Disorders/drug therapy","Anxiety/therapy","Distress","Humans","Minor tranquilizers","Network meta-analysis","Randomized Controlled Trials as Topic","Systematic review"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-0413AF3B7D14C5A4032840912EB238D9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/387439149/s00406_023_01680_0.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/276924486/Open_Access_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00406-023-01680-0","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Mental Health Services CPH"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danish Health Authority"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Mental Health Services in the Region of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"4",